## Quick Start: Developer Setup

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies (uv project; Python {{ python_version }} from .python-version)
uv sync

# 2. Quality gate: run before every commit (ruff, mypy --strict, size limits, secret scan, pytest)
scripts/check.sh
{% if is_cli %}

# 3. Run the CLI
uv run {{ project_slug }} --help
{% endif %}
{% if is_service %}

# 3. Run the service (copy .env.example to .env first)
uv run uvicorn {{ package_name }}.infrastructure.api.app:create_app --factory --reload
docker compose up --build
{% endif %}
```

Add dependencies with `uv add <pkg>` (or `uv add --dev <pkg>`). Do not edit `uv.lock` by hand.

